      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The human foot is subjected to a large number and variety of stresses. Consequently, virtually every person will at one time or another experience a painful disorder of the foot. The first line of treatment is normally footwear modification and relief from the inciting event or cause. When this is unsuccessful, various surgical procedures may often be of benefit."},
